  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Fix\n\nResolved a publish conflict (NETSDK1152) caused by duplicate files in the App_Plugins/Phases.Umbraco.NeatTip directory during deployment.\n\nThe issue occurred when files were included both from the NuGet contentFiles and the web project App_Plugins folder.\n\nImprovement\n\nUpdated package configuration to prevent duplicate asset publishing in Umbraco Cloud and standard .NET publish pipelines.\n\nImpact\n\nFixes deployment failures during dotnet publish on Umbraco 13+ projects.\n\nEnsures clean deployment in Umbraco Cloud / Azure environments.",
